{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Banu, a young woman who moves from the Middle East to the West for one month, and watch her life turn upside down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/a9e69dd9593258cf4689bf7d565db94b.avif?t=1765611579\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You control Banu in this adult visual novel where every choice matters. She struggles between her traditions and the temptations around her\u2014meeting new people, facing danger, and discovering secret desires she never imagined.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Female protagonist</strong> \u2013 make decisions as Banu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/db9c3ba4eb81be4c92056ae8e0d3b25e.poster.avif?t=1765611579\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/db9c3ba4eb81be4c92056ae8e0d3b25e.webm?t=1765611579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 every path can lead to love, betrayal, lust, or heartbreak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/1dc0abd22d4fedf0aa141b22a9224edf.avif?t=1765611579\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple routes and endings</strong> to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/9b114aeb70610f3452ccaeeebc632c4e.avif?t=1765611579\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully animated scenes</strong> with high-quality visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/b5798084ce835d4d01418a103704fc1d.poster.avif?t=1765611579\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/b5798084ce835d4d01418a103704fc1d.webm?t=1765611579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound effects &amp; voices</strong> \u2013 moaning, ambient sounds, and more for immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original music soundtrack</strong> that sets the mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes include: <strong>romance, lesbian love, dangerous encounters, cultural struggle, and temptation.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/28b4d9a3b2ce98714c989ecfe811f756.poster.avif?t=1765611579\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056530/extras/28b4d9a3b2ce98714c989ecfe811f756.webm?t=1765611579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will Banu stay loyal to her husband\u2026 or give in to her secret desires?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Her story is in your hands.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr